  "intro": "New Orleans is the most marine-heavy region on this site. The lower Mississippi from Baton Rouge to the passes is one of the densest concentrations of commercial shipping anywhere: ocean vessels, river tows, crew boats, and the pilot associations that hand them off to each other, all on VHF, all day. Offshore, the helicopter traffic serving the Gulf rigs is constant. And hurricane season makes the weather transmitters and the interoperability channels a genuine safety matter rather than a curiosity.",
  "introz": "新奥尔良是本站海事内容最重的地区。从巴吞鲁日到河口的密西西比河下游，是全球商业航运最密集的水域之一：远洋船、河上顶推船、交通艇，以及在它们之间交接的引航员协会，全天都在 VHF 上通话。近海方向，服务墨西哥湾钻井平台的直升机往来不断。而飓风季节让气象发射台和互通频道成为真正的安全事项，而非猎奇。",
